WEBVTT

00:13:58.716 --> 00:14:01.269
a s druge, važnije strane

00:14:02.593 --> 00:14:05.187
to je timski napor,
i ako mislite da sam ja faca,

00:14:05.187 --> 00:14:06.651
trebalo bi da upoznate Boni."

00:14:06.651 --> 00:14:08.026
(Smeh)

00:14:08.026 --> 00:14:10.541
Boni, gde si?

00:14:10.541 --> 00:14:12.182
Gde si?

00:14:13.164 --> 00:14:16.954
Ono je Boni Stol.
(Aplauz)

00:14:16.954 --> 00:14:18.904
Moj drugar.

00:14:21.072 --> 00:14:23.541
Da citiram Henrija Dejvida Toroa:

00:14:23.541 --> 00:14:26.955
"Kada postigneš svoje snove,
nije bitno šta dobiješ time,

00:14:26.995 --> 00:14:29.501
koliko šta postaneš tokom procesa."

00:14:29.501 --> 00:14:31.639
I tako, stojim tu pred vama,